<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#15364c">
  <title>Page Not Found | The Learning Studio</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/music-studio-app-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Rye&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{--navy:#15364c;--ink:#19303a;--paper:#fff8dc;--yellow:#ffde24;--teal:#087f76;--coral:#d96c50}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{background:#d9eee9;color:var(--ink);display:grid;font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;letter-spacing:0;margin:0;min-height:100vh;place-items:center}
    body::before{background:linear-gradient(rgba(217,238,233,.83),rgba(217,238,233,.92)),url('/images/hanford-piano-teacher.webp') center/cover;content:"";inset:0;position:fixed;z-index:-1}
    main{background:var(--paper);border:2px solid var(--navy);border-left:9px solid var(--coral);box-shadow:12px 12px 0 rgba(21,54,76,.14);margin:24px;max-width:720px;padding:clamp(30px,7vw,70px);width:calc(100% - 48px)}
    .code{color:var(--teal);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}
    h1{color:var(--navy);font-family:Rye,serif;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,8vw,5.3rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.04;margin:12px 0 20px}
    p{font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.18rem);line-height:1.65;margin:0;max-width:570px}
    .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:30px}
    a{border:2px solid var(--navy);border-radius:4px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;padding:11px 17px;text-decoration:none}
    a:first-child{background:var(--yellow)}
    a:hover,a:focus-visible{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;outline:none}
    .notes{color:var(--teal);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem);margin-bottom:8px;word-spacing:12px}
    @media(max-width:480px){main{margin:14px;padding:28px 22px;width:calc(100% - 28px)}.actions{display:grid}.actions a{text-align:center}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="notes" aria-hidden="true">♪ ♯ ♫</div>
    <div class="code">404 · Page not found</div>
    <h1>This path has gone off-score.</h1>
    <p>The page may have moved, changed its name, or wandered somewhere unexpected. Let us return to a place where the music is still playing.</p>
    <nav class="actions" aria-label="Page not found options">
      <a href="/">Return to the studio</a>
      <a href="/reports">Open the student portal</a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
